Title: Locally Robust Commensurate BART
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("MAP-BART revision", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "koaeraser@gmail.com")
Description: Bayesian additive regression trees with a sparse discrepancy
    ensemble carrying a spike-and-slab commensurate prior, for borrowing
    real-world control data into a randomized trial (method_spec.md v2).
